# Secrets
.env

# All local data is regenerable and none of it is tracked. The V3 panel is
# rebuilt with `python -m research.panel --download`; V2's sector CSVs, news
# archive and processed state files are superseded and remain on Version-1.
# Nothing in here is a source of truth — RESEARCH_LOG.md is.
data/
output/

# Research outputs — regenerable by re-running the phase that produced them.
# Findings belong in RESEARCH_LOG.md, which IS tracked; the artifacts are not.
research/results/

# Desktop app UI local history (V2, removed) — regenerated per machine
stockanalysis_history.db

